    "wl_image_text_cta_za6tW4": {
      "type": "wl-image-text-cta",
      "blocks": {
        "image_ipYjV6": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ChatGPT_Image_Jun_17_2026_04_24_09_PM.png",
            "bkg_color": "#595378",
            "font_color": "#ffffff",
            "tagline": "",
            "title": "What Are CBD Tinctures?",
            "content": "<p>CBD tinctures are liquid hemp extracts designed for fast, convenient CBD supplementation. Typically taken under the tongue, CBD oil tinctures allow for flexible serving sizes and may support relaxation, stress management, sleep, recovery, and overall wellness. Available in full-spectrum, broad-spectrum, and CBD isolate formulas, CBD tinctures are one of the most popular ways to incorporate hemp-derived cannabinoids into a daily wellness routine.</p>",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_link": ""
          }
        },
        "image_Cam9hg": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/sublingual.png",
            "bkg_color": "#ffd700",
            "font_color": "#010101",
            "tagline": "",
            "title": "Sublingual vs. Other Delivery Methods",
            "content": "<p>Sublingual CBD is a method of taking CBD by placing drops from a tincture under the tongue and holding it there for 30–60 seconds before swallowing. This allows CBD to be absorbed directly into the bloodstream through the tissues under the tongue, often resulting in faster absorption and a quicker onset of effects compared to CBD mixed into food or drinks. While CBD edibles and beverages must pass through the digestive system before being absorbed, sublingual CBD may offer greater bioavailability and more consistent results, making it a popular choice for those seeking efficient daily CBD support.</p>",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_link": ""
          }
        },
        "image_GP3xtF": {
          "type": "image",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/plant-powered-focus-blend.png",
            "bkg_color": "#bcd868",
            "font_color": "#010101",
            "tagline": "",
            "title": "CBD Gummies VS Delta 9 THC Gummies",
            "content": "<p>While both products are gummy-based cannabinoid supplements, they are designed for different experiences. HempLucid's <strong>Full-Spectrum CBD Gummy Cubes</strong> contain 25mg of CBD per gummy and are formulated for everyday wellness support, featuring organic hemp extract and clean ingredients without artificial dyes, sweeteners, or corn syrup. </p><p>In contrast, our <strong>Delta-9 THC + CBD Gummies</strong> combine 5-10mg of Delta-9 THC with 10-50mg of CBD, creating a more noticeable cannabinoid experience that may promote deeper relaxation and a mild psychoactive effect. HempLucid positions these gummies for consumers seeking an extra level of support beyond CBD alone, with effects typically felt more quickly than traditional CBD gummies. </p><p>For customers who want the wellness benefits of hemp without a significant THC experience, the Full-Spectrum CBD Gummy Cubes are the better fit. Those looking for a stronger relaxation experience that includes the effects of THC may prefer the CBD + Delta-9 THC Gummies. </p>",
            "cta_text": "",
            "cta_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
